<title>USA: U.S. April industrial output unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. April industrial output unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Board report of U.S. industrial production and capacity utilization, seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p> Total Industrial:	  Apr    Mar    Feb    Jan   Apr97/96</p>
<p> Production, Pct Change  UNCH    0.6    0.5    0.1    4.1</p>
